  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Teenage Pregnancy Prevention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fewer pregnancies amongst teenagers, through involving community leaders and men, repurposing initiation rituals, sex education in schools, youth-friendly health services, and helping girls stay in school or do vocational training. Year 1 funded by EMMS COVID-19 response.</narrative>
  </description>
